{"id":"619645","name":"南瓜馒头","author":"一溪月","authorId":"10449735","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/619645/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"发酵粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"南瓜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"白糖","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"贝贝南瓜蒸熟，去皮，放入破壁机。","img":"images/619645/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"清水稍低于南瓜，加入一点白糖。","img":"images/619645/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"用果蔬键打成南瓜泥。","img":"images/619645/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"待南瓜泥温热，倒入酶母粉搅匀。","img":"images/619645/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"南瓜泥倒面粉中。","img":"images/619645/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"搅成絮状。","img":"images/619645/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"揉成软硬适中的面团，放温暖处饧发。","img":"images/619645/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"发好的面团。","img":"images/619645/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"取适量面团，排气，揪成100g一个的剂子。","img":"images/619645/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"揉成光滑的馒头。","img":"images/619645/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放温暖处饧发。","img":"images/619645/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"待馒头坯饧发好。冷水上屉，中火蒸20分钟。","img":"images/619645/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"蒸好的南瓜馒头。","img":"images/619645/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/619645/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/619645/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}